        "slc_c38647422f18195d47c92bb8c208fde1b4c40478449782afebcdbac9b7606f5a"
      ],
      "text": "The framework wraps an external TermLink binary for cross-terminal, cross-host worker sessions, with bus manifest/read, dispatch send over SSH, and pickup verbs for coordination."
    },
