      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d6b30f4178c4c6544c9644934a735fa5078a69e1cc26925d13949c34626c7b5f"
      ],
      "text": "A Framework MCP server exposes 22 capabilities (16 read-only, 6 agent-authority) to external agents; five sovereignty-bound verbs are deliberately never registered, and agent-authority tools shell out through bin/fw so the same gates fire."
    },
